    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to No. 39 Oakdale, a beautifully presented two bedroom home that has been recently renovated and redecorated to an exceptional standard throughout. \nUpon entering, you are greeted by a bright and welcoming entrance hall that sets the tone for the quality and style found throughout the property. The spacious open plan sitting and dining room is flooded with natural light and features attractive timber flooring together with a fitted insert stove, creating a warm and comfortable living space ideal for relaxing or entertaining. \nThe galley-style kitchen is conveniently located off the main living area and offers a practical layout with ample storage and workspace.\nUpstairs, there are two generously sized bedrooms, both benefiting from built-in wardrobes and tasteful dcor. A modern shower room completes the first floor accommodation and has been finished to a high standard.\nExternally, the property offers off street parking for one car to the front and an enclosed side yard, providing a private outdoor space that is easy to maintain.\nIdeally located in the popular Baylough area, No. 39 Oakdale enjoys excellent convenience with a local bus stop nearby, a Tesco Express situated directly across from the development, and easy access to the motorway network for commuters.\nThis is a superb opportunity to rent a stylish, turnkey home in a highly convenient residential location.\nMinimum 12-month lease\nFully furnished\nFor all enquiries please EMAIL info@hynes.ie along with references. \n\nDisclaimer:\nREA Hynes has taken every care in the preparation of these particulars; however, all information is provided for guidance only and prospective tenants should satisfy themselves as to its accuracy."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Key Features:\nRecently renovated and redecorated throughout\nTwo-bedroom mid-terrace home\nOff-street parking for one car\nSpacious sitting/dining room with insert stove\nTimber flooring throughout living areas\nModern galley kitchen\nTwo bedrooms with built-in wardrobes\nContemporary shower room\nOil-fired central heating\nEnclosed side yard\nTesco Express directly opposite the development\nLocal bus service nearby\nEasy access to Athlone town centre and motorway network\nMinimum 12-month lease\nFully furnished\nFor all enquiries please EMAIL info@hynes.ie along with references."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Donna Hynes"
      }
    ],
